 "emoji": "🌋",
 "sentences": [
  "Most volcanoes are actually hidden underwater.",
  "A volcano is a vent or fissure letting hot lava, volcanic ash, and gases escape from below.",
  "They form where tectonic plates diverge or converge.",
  "Divergent plates usually create nonexplosive volcanoes.",
  "Convergent plates cause violent eruptions.",
  "Some volcanoes also form where crust plates stretch and thin.",
  "Hotspot volcanism happens away from these boundaries due to deep mantle plumes."
